        },
        {
          "text": " Akakora ebihagaro bingi munonga omu kukuratira ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, nk'ebi Abaamori baakozire byona, abu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, oku byabaire biri. ",
