        {
          "text": " Ahabu ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebyo, yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaajwara ebiguniya, yaayesiibyakwo abyami omu biguniya, yaagyenda ayeinamiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
