        {
          "text": " Oreebire Ahabu oku ayecureize omu maisho gangye? Ahabw'okwecureeza omu maisho gangye, tindireeta kabii omu busingye bwe; kureka omu busingye bw'omutabani nimwo ndireetera akabi aha nju ye.",
